Package: WeibullModiAMR
Type: Package
Title: Fit Modified Weibull-Type Distributions
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Dr Ajaykumar", "Rangoli", email = "drajaykumarmr1008@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides maximum likelihood estimation methods for eight modified 
    Weibull-type distributions. It returns parameter estimates, 
    log-likelihood, AIC, and BIC, and also supports model fitting, validation, 
    and comparison across different distributional forms. These methods can be 
    applied to reliability, survival, and lifetime data analysis, making the package 
    useful for researchers and practitioners in statistics, engineering, and medicine. 
    The following distributions are included: Rangoli2023, Peng2014, Lai2003, Xie1996, 
    Sarhan2009, Rangoli2025, Mustafa2012, and Alwasel2009.
